        "id": 221152,
        "name": "jasonr1023",
        "username": "jasonr1023",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/aeb1de/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-23T16:55:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This would be awesome!&nbsp; I am new to the game - just got the collectors box (kickstarter&nbsp;with all perks) and all of the expansions.<br>We've played through about 10 games.&nbsp; Love it!<br><br>I am a completionist at heart.&nbsp; I'd love to have these two cards, but is there a way for me to see if I already have them?&nbsp; I'd hate to take them from someone else that needs them for their set.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks in advance!!!</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:53:46.729Z",
