        "raw": "[quote=\"jasonr1023\"]\n\nThis would be awesome!&nbsp; I am new to the game - just got the collectors box (kickstarter&nbsp;with all perks) and all of the expansions.We&#39;ve played through about 10 games.&nbsp; Love it!I am a completionist at heart.&nbsp; I&#39;d love to have these two cards, but is there a way for me to see if I already have them?&nbsp; I&#39;d hate to take them from someone else that needs them for their set.&nbsp;Thanks in advance!!!\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe way you&#39;ll have them is in the oversized pack: on one side of the Infinitor variant, it will say something like &quot;Tormented Hero&quot;; the Kismet variant is something like &quot;Unsubtle Trickster.&quot;\n\nThey were originally only released in the (updated) oversized pack; Adam eventually did small art for them to match the other &quot;normal&quot; villain character cards. If you&#39;ve got small character cards matching those descriptions,&nbsp; you&#39;ve got them.\n",
